WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Big Buck Bunny

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A gentle bunny wakes up in a sunlit forest.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The morning is peaceful and calm.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Three rodents appear from the undergrowth.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
They begin to torment the forest creatures.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
But Big Buck Bunny will not stand for it.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.000
He devises an elaborate plan of revenge.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:36.000
The chase begins through the forest!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.000
[Dramatic music intensifies]

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Justice is served at last.
